        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Here’s a polished version of your message you can send to your lawyer:  \n\n---\n\n**Subject:** Clarification on Enforcement and Invoice  \n\nDear [Lawyer’s Name],  \n\nI’m writing in response to the recent email I received. There was no other enforcement — I only received a letter, and I have been trying to pay it off. Could you please clarify what “other enforcement” refers to?  \n\nAlso, when was this invoice issued, and for what specific purpose? I already submitted Form T14 and made it clear that I intend to pay that amount. This ongoing situation feels like harassment, as I’m trying to resolve the matter properly.  \n\nThank you for your attention to this. I look forward to your clarification.  \n\nKind regards,  \n**Amit Puri**\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to make it sound *more formal* or *more firm/defensive* (for a stronger tone)?"
          ]
        },
